## Migrations (Alembic)

Schema changes are managed with Alembic. `migrations/env.py` reads `DATABASE_URL` from
your settings at run time and targets `app.db.models.Base.metadata`, so autogenerate sees
every mapped table.

```bash
just migration "describe the change"   # alembic revision --autogenerate -m ...
just migrate                           # alembic upgrade head
```

